                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cute short game, BUT\n\nI have some difficulties and I could not find a solution anywhere.\n\n[spoiler]1. After completing the main story (defeating final boss) the game is stuck in the \"THANKS FOR PLAYING!\" screen and there is no way to exit it and save progress. I have to restart the game, but the final boss is not killed again.\n\n2. As I understand it, to get into the gray zones of the biomes you need a bow, and it is obtained from a closed room on the left at the top of the town. And as I understand it, this room will become available after you get all the weapons from all the secret rooms of all biomes. But I can’t get into the secret room of the devil biome at all, although I understand where it is (marked on the map). [/spoiler]",
